00:15:45.350 --> 00:15:47.490
Wanita yang akan mati hari ini...

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:49.630
Benarkah?..

00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:21.460
Saya ingin mati.

00:16:21.890 --> 00:16:23.430
Haruskah aku bunuh diri?

00:16:23.630 --> 00:16:25.500
